{"suttaId":"thag10.6","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"Th","vriCode":"s0508m.mul","paras":[2410,2440],"vripara":"577"},"segments":{"thag10.6:0.4":"Vaṅgantaputtaupasenattheragāthā","thag10.6:1.1":"“Vivittaṃ appanigghosaṃ, vāḷamiganisevitaṃ;","thag10.6:1.3":"Seve senāsanaṃ bhikkhu, paṭisallānakāraṇā.","thag10.6:2.1":"“Saṅkārapuñjā āhatvā [āhitvā (ka.)], susānā rathiyāhi ca;","thag10.6:2.3":"Tato saṅghāṭikaṃ katvā, lūkhaṃ dhāreyya cīvaraṃ.","thag10.6:3.1":"“Nīcaṃ manaṃ karitvāna, sapadānaṃ kulā kulaṃ;","thag10.6:3.3":"Piṇḍikāya care bhikkhu, guttadvāro susaṃvuto.","thag10.6:4.1":"“Lūkhenapi vā [lūkhenapi ca (bahūsu)] santusse, nāññaṃ patthe rasaṃ bahuṃ;","thag10.6:4.3":"Rasesu anugiddhassa, jhāne na ramatī mano.","thag10.6:5.1":"“Appiccho ceva santuṭṭho, pavivitto vase muni;","thag10.6:5.3":"Asaṃsaṭṭho gahaṭṭhehi, anāgārehi cūbhayaṃ.","thag10.6:6.1":"“Yathā jaḷo va mūgo va, attānaṃ dassaye tathā;","thag10.6:6.3":"Nātivelaṃ sambhāseyya, saṅghamajjhamhi paṇḍito.","thag10.6:7.1":"“Na so upavade kañci, upaghātaṃ vivajjaye;","thag10.6:7.3":"Saṃvuto pātimokkhasmiṃ, mattaññū cassa bhojane.","thag10.6:8.1":"“Suggahītanimittassa, cittassuppādakovido;","thag10.6:8.3":"Samaṃ anuyuñjeyya, kālena ca vipassanaṃ.","thag10.6:9.1":"“Vīriyasātaccasampanno, yuttayogo sadā siyā;","thag10.6:9.3":"Na ca appatvā dukkhantaṃ, vissāsaṃ eyya paṇḍito.","thag10.6:10.1":"“Evaṃ viharamānassa, suddhikāmassa bhikkhuno;","thag10.6:10.3":"Khīyanti āsavā sabbe, nibbutiñcādhigacchatī”ti.","thag10.6:10.5":"… Upaseno vaṅgantaputto thero …."},"attha":{"book":"Th-a-ii","bookName":"Theragāthā-1-aṭṭhakathā","vriCode":"s0508a2.att","from":2517,"to":2517,"paras":[{"para":2517,"vripara":null,"refs":["thag10.6:10"],"lines":["<b>Evaṃ viharamānassā</b>ti, evaṃ vivittasenāsanasevanādinā vipassanāvasena yuttayogatāpariyosānena vidhinā viharantassa.","<b>Suddhikāmassā</b>ti, ñāṇadassanavisuddhiṃ accantavisuddhiṃ nibbānaṃ arahattañca icchantassa.","Saṃsāre bhayassa ikkhato <b>bhikkhuno,</b> kāmāsavādayo sabbe <b>āsavā khīyanti</b> khayaṃ abbhatthaṃ gacchanti, tesaṃ khayagamaneneva saupādisesaanupādisesapabhedaṃ duvidhampi nibbānaṃ <b>adhigacchati</b> pāpuṇāti."],"lineRefs":[["thag10.6:10"],["thag10.6:10"],["thag10.6:10"]]}],"wordLinks":[["thag10.6:10.1","evaṃ viharamānassā",0,0],["thag10.6:10.1","suddhikāmassā",0,1],["thag10.6:10.1","bhikkhuno",0,2]]},"tika":null}
